    "updated_at": "2026-08-13T00:29:15Z",
    "body": "Just a few heuristics makes the first few seem more reasonable:\n - the part before `:` must be lowercase ascii letters\n - after the `:` cannot be a `/` (just for links)\n\n(I can't figure out how to make that search case-sensitive so I just ignored those)",
